<p>Lat (Latitude)<strong>:</strong> denotes how far north or south we are</=
p>
<p>Long (Longitude)<strong>:</strong> denotes how far east or west we are</=
p>
<h4 id=3D"going-from-3d-to-2d">Going from 3D to 2D</h4>
<p>The process of translating the points from a 3D globe to a 2D plane is c=
alled =E2=80=9CMap Projection=E2=80=9D.</p>
<p>There are different ways to do map projection, and each comes with its o=
wn strengths and limitations. Almost all of them distort the actual geometr=
y. Below we can see some examples.</p>
