 a coarse division of the globe.  Each of these sections is further subdivi=
ded into a 2x2 grid in the next level, resulting in a 4x4 grid of smaller m=
ap sections, each labeled with a two-digit binary code (e.g., '0100', '1110=
').  This process continues to a much finer level, shown in the bottom larg=
