cal position within the quadtree.  Some larger regions are labeled with con=
tinent names (e.g., 'Europe', 'Asia', 'North America', 'South America', 'Au=
stralia', 'Antarctica').  Arrows indicate the hierarchical relationship bet=
ween levels, showing how a higher-level section is decomposed into lower-le=
vel sections. The bottom of the image includes a copyright notice stating t=
