ure 12 Map rendering</figcaption></div></figure>
<ol>
<li>
<p>A mobile user calls the map tile service to fetch the tile URLs. The req=
uest is sent to the load balancer.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>The load balancer forwards the request to the map tile service.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>The map tile service takes the client=E2=80=99s location and zoom level =
as inputs and returns 9 URLs of the tiles to the client. These tiles includ=
e the tile to render and the eight surrounding tiles.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>The mobile client downloads the tiles from the CDN.</p>
</li>
